    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0160_sister_06",
      "hash64": "3E1B4A8EF00DCD34",
      "text": "虽然很想乘胜追击，\\n但是零花钱剩得不多了……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0160_sister_07",
      "hash64": "3E1B4B8EF00DCEE7",
      "text": "阿栗！你来代替我\\n让[VAR 0x0100(0000)]接着输！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
